Scope of this repository
-------------------------
This repository contains only the deployment configuration required to
install HOPE LMS from Google Cloud Marketplace via the command line: the
Helm chart, the Marketplace parameter schema, the deployer/tester container
build files, and this documentation. It does not contain the HOPE LMS
application source code, which remains proprietary to CornerstoneX and is
distributed exclusively as container images through Google Cloud Marketplace
under the HOPE LMS commercial license agreement.

